WEBVTT

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:32.209
[Full-Time Magister 2]

00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:35.542
♪ The rising dawn
cuts through the night ♪

00:00:35.767 --> 00:00:38.463
♪ And destroys the darkness ♪

00:00:38.562 --> 00:00:42.549
♪ A new wing shall emerge ♪

00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:46.185
♪ And soar through the sky ♪

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.357
♪ Smoke appears in
conflicted dimensions ♪

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:53.293
♪ Waiting for someone's arrival ♪

00:00:53.689 --> 00:00:58.234
♪ Protecting the unshakable
belief within us ♪

00:00:58.474 --> 00:01:00.372
♪ And never backs down ♪

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:04.876
♪ The sacred fountain lays there ♪

00:01:05.312 --> 00:01:08.633
♪ Shocked by what appeared
in front of us ♪

00:01:09.019 --> 00:01:12.065
♪ The star atlas has open
a path for our journey ♪

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.505
♪ Laughing while we watch
the world from above ♪

00:01:15.938 --> 00:01:19.040
♪ He had given me everything ♪

00:01:19.134 --> 00:01:23.218
♪ The truth in sight is unpleasant ♪

00:01:23.258 --> 00:01:25.980
♪ Anger that is insurmountable ♪

00:01:25.981 --> 00:01:30.389
♪ That unique soul
was born to be a hero ♪

00:01:30.532 --> 00:01:33.659
♪ The torrential rain can't be
stopped by the hot-blooded ♪

00:01:33.699 --> 00:01:37.584
♪ The chosen one will not
bid farewell easily ♪

00:01:37.606 --> 00:01:40.449
♪ I will create a miracle ♪

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:45.986
♪ With the burning fire
in my wounded heart ♪

00:01:46.193 --> 00:01:50.284
♪ I promise ♪

00:02:00.104 --> 00:02:02.013
-Mo Fan.
-Are you okay?

00:02:03.989 --> 00:02:04.762
I'm okay.

00:02:11.602 --> 00:02:13.269
Why is this beast disappearing itself?

00:02:13.837 --> 00:02:15.863
A Black Beast's soul
is linked to its owner.

00:02:17.135 --> 00:02:18.335
Once its owner dies,

00:02:18.483 --> 00:02:20.203
the beast will die too.

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:21.723
I see.

00:02:22.197 --> 00:02:23.357
It's finally over.

00:02:35.639 --> 00:02:36.626
Monkey.

00:02:38.511 --> 00:02:39.511
Brother Fan.

00:02:41.025 --> 00:02:43.158
I have to become more capable!

00:02:47.975 --> 00:02:48.802
Mo Fan!

00:02:50.468 --> 00:02:52.187
Mo Fan, we found you finally.

00:02:52.595 --> 00:02:53.177
You...

00:02:54.378 --> 00:02:55.232
What happened?

00:02:57.781 --> 00:02:58.701
Don't be nervous.

00:02:59.202 --> 00:03:01.840
Mo Fan, it's great to find you here.

00:03:02.313 --> 00:03:03.127
Are you okay?

00:03:04.678 --> 00:03:07.456
Why did this scene happen again?
It's like we're in a TV drama.

00:03:07.738 --> 00:03:09.085
After everything is over,

00:03:09.165 --> 00:03:10.419
then the people who
should save us will appear.

00:03:11.392 --> 00:03:12.931
Zhao Kunsan, stop talking nonsense.

00:03:15.001 --> 00:03:16.742
We're too late.

00:03:18.381 --> 00:03:20.321
-Yang Zhuohe.
-Mr. Yang.

00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:22.791
They killed one of our colleagues.

00:03:26.359 --> 00:03:29.063
This man is a scoundrel.
He started attacking us first.

00:03:30.932 --> 00:03:31.745
Calm down.

00:03:32.602 --> 00:03:34.245
Mo Fan, what happened?

00:03:35.412 --> 00:03:37.145
Instructor Bai Yang is from
the Black Curia.

00:03:37.613 --> 00:03:38.973
You can check these few areas.

00:03:39.292 --> 00:03:41.751
There are black puddles left over
after the death of Black Beasts.

00:03:45.605 --> 00:03:46.965
How can Bai Yang be a traitor?

00:03:48.215 --> 00:03:49.268
This area isn't safe.

00:03:50.216 --> 00:03:52.403
Let's talk back
in the protective barrier.

00:03:53.354 --> 00:03:56.406
Stay here and check on
the black puddles.

00:03:56.843 --> 00:03:59.417
The rest of you, escort them back
to the protective barrier.

00:04:00.357 --> 00:04:01.664
The Black Curia infiltrated into us.

00:04:02.234 --> 00:04:04.728
There may be their people in the army.

00:04:05.493 --> 00:04:06.827
We'll know whether
Bai Yang is a traitor or not...

00:04:07.276 --> 00:04:10.134
by bringing the black puddles
and Bai Yang's corpse back to examine.

00:04:11.154 --> 00:04:13.300
Why do we have to do
meaningless things here?

00:04:13.766 --> 00:04:14.473
Yes.

00:04:23.364 --> 00:04:24.938
Is this the protective barrier?

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:26.958
Yes. If we're here,

00:04:27.225 --> 00:04:28.612
we'll be safe.

00:04:34.319 --> 00:04:35.921
Everyone, be quick and follow me in.

00:05:09.167 --> 00:05:11.209
Do we have to enter the Sacred Spring?

00:05:11.834 --> 00:05:14.960
I don't think there's a need to do so.
There isn't anyone who is still alive.

00:05:15.888 --> 00:05:17.474
One-eyed Wolf Demons keep...

00:05:17.511 --> 00:05:18.922
coming near to Pterolycus.

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:21.650
There are also many Thorn-Faced Wolves.

00:05:22.432 --> 00:05:25.239
No matter how many people we send here,
we wouldn't be able to kill them all.

00:05:26.208 --> 00:05:29.482
If that's the case, we can't carry out
the plan to kill the Pterolycus.

00:05:31.122 --> 00:05:34.563
Where did the One-eyed Wolf Demons
come from?

00:05:35.726 --> 00:05:37.833
Xuefeng Mountain's post house
wasn't captured.

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:40.270
But, they appeared in the city
for no reason.

00:05:40.498 --> 00:05:41.725
Their numbers keep increasing.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:45.040
Don't tell me it's Space Magic?

00:05:45.815 --> 00:05:46.802
Impossible.

00:05:47.129 --> 00:05:48.342
Even the Black Curia...

00:05:48.586 --> 00:05:50.293
couldn't master this.

00:05:50.907 --> 00:05:53.116
We should return to
the protective barrier.

00:05:53.588 --> 00:05:55.334
There are many creatures
surrounding the Pterolycus.

00:05:55.727 --> 00:05:57.447
It's hard for Zhan Kong
and his 10 adjutants...

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.797
to get close to the Pterolycus.

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:01.780
We have to send news about
the situation here.

00:06:03.674 --> 00:06:05.461
We have to report this situation.

00:06:07.022 --> 00:06:08.062
Let's leave.

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:19.820
How did...

00:06:20.334 --> 00:06:22.945
How did it discover us?

00:06:23.225 --> 00:06:24.305
It's true.

00:06:24.444 --> 00:06:26.378
This creature has
a wide perception range!

00:06:55.373 --> 00:06:58.813
Are we that vulnerable?

00:07:03.462 --> 00:07:05.102
Really? That's great.

00:07:06.012 --> 00:07:07.636
Everyone, Mr. Xue called...

00:07:07.756 --> 00:07:09.129
to inform that the protective barrier
is still there.

00:07:09.291 --> 00:07:10.891
The pioneer team has reached there.

00:07:12.407 --> 00:07:13.822
Let's be quick and depart.

00:07:14.404 --> 00:07:15.097
Yes.

00:07:29.433 --> 00:07:30.793
How horrible.

00:07:30.922 --> 00:07:33.936
Everyone must have encountered
many things on the way here.

00:07:35.687 --> 00:07:37.701
But, it's safe here.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.000
The others should be here soon.

00:07:50.363 --> 00:07:52.323
Go up, he is waiting for you.

00:07:56.433 --> 00:08:00.409
Boss, Mr. Yang Zhuohe sent over
Bai Yang's autopsy report.

00:08:00.701 --> 00:08:03.141
There are signs of decaying
Black Beast in his heart.

00:08:04.124 --> 00:08:07.031
Bai Yang is a spy from Black Curia.

00:08:07.327 --> 00:08:10.207
He met the pioneer team
from the school earlier than us.

00:08:10.715 --> 00:08:12.568
He nearly killed them all.

00:08:17.687 --> 00:08:19.386
Boss, Mo Fan is here.

00:08:24.921 --> 00:08:27.215
Mo Fan, I'm happy...

00:08:27.329 --> 00:08:28.449
that you're alive.

00:08:29.389 --> 00:08:30.549
Yes, I'm alive.

00:08:30.988 --> 00:08:33.348
But, some of my friends died.

00:08:33.727 --> 00:08:36.891
Moreover, they were killed by
your subordinate, Bai Yang.

00:08:37.437 --> 00:08:38.877
Bai Yang belongs to the Black Curia.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:40.850
which really astonished me.

00:08:41.861 --> 00:08:43.407
It was my fault.

00:08:43.833 --> 00:08:45.340
I was completely unaware.

00:08:45.386 --> 00:08:47.706
Zhang Yinglu was an optimistic girl.

00:08:48.026 --> 00:08:50.733
She was attacked by a Cyclops
when she was leading the way.

00:08:51.789 --> 00:08:53.189
She didn't even had a chance to react.

00:08:53.443 --> 00:08:55.123
He Yu was timid and cautious.

00:08:55.256 --> 00:08:56.740
She couldn't even cast magic well.

00:08:57.047 --> 00:08:59.840
But, at that critical moment,
she cast the magic perfectly...

00:09:00.005 --> 00:09:01.565
to protect others.

00:09:01.735 --> 00:09:03.522
They were capable.

00:09:03.934 --> 00:09:05.827
I'm proud to be...

00:09:05.883 --> 00:09:07.114
the Head Instructor of your batch.

00:09:07.701 --> 00:09:08.535
By the way, Mo Fan,

00:09:08.814 --> 00:09:12.386
we didn't realise that Bai Yang
was from the Black Curia.

00:09:12.653 --> 00:09:14.959
How did you know something
was wrong with Bai Yang?

00:09:16.114 --> 00:09:17.527
I didn't know something
was wrong with him.

00:09:18.088 --> 00:09:20.728
I was on alert.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:22.384
Since I refused to hand
the Sacred Spring to him,

00:09:22.455 --> 00:09:24.215
Bai Yang revealed his identity.

00:09:25.282 --> 00:09:27.696
You did a great job.
Then, where is the Sacred Spring?

00:09:27.891 --> 00:09:29.238
You should feel assured...

00:09:29.553 --> 00:09:31.073
handing it to me.

00:09:32.350 --> 00:09:34.363
This isn't about feeling assured.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:37.252
Actually, the Sacred Spring was...

00:09:38.977 --> 00:09:39.817
drank by me.

00:09:42.226 --> 00:09:43.394
Are you joking?

00:09:43.584 --> 00:09:45.624
Do you know what
the Sacred Spring represents?

00:09:45.667 --> 00:09:49.709
It enables Bow City to have
one more level 2 mage every year.

00:09:50.630 --> 00:09:51.737
I wasn't joking.

00:09:51.951 --> 00:09:53.285
It was urgent.

00:09:53.425 --> 00:09:54.452
So, I drank...

00:09:56.994 --> 00:09:59.599
You really drank it all?

00:09:59.745 --> 00:10:00.731
Yes.

00:10:00.875 --> 00:10:02.821
Spit it back out!

00:10:05.639 --> 00:10:09.073
I heard that the Sacred Spring
will dry up one day.

00:10:09.317 --> 00:10:11.690
Moreover, it has been used it for years.

00:10:11.743 --> 00:10:13.271
If it's gone, forget it then.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:15.607
Zhan Kong, stop it...

00:10:17.166 --> 00:10:19.779
Protecting Bow City is
the most important thing now.

00:10:20.031 --> 00:10:22.458
It's better than being captured
by the Black Curia.

00:10:23.764 --> 00:10:25.425
Boss, calm down.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:37.254
Forget it.

00:10:41.423 --> 00:10:43.063
It's good that
the Sacred Spring is gone.

00:10:43.372 --> 00:10:48.937
It brought more disaster than blessing
to Bow City.

00:10:49.533 --> 00:10:50.698
What should we do next?

00:10:50.913 --> 00:10:52.096
The Pterolycus is still in the city.

00:10:52.341 --> 00:10:54.768
Besides, the numbers of
One-eyed Wolf Demon kept increasing.

00:10:55.831 --> 00:10:58.964
From what I know, there are many people
who stayed in the building.

00:11:00.046 --> 00:11:01.260
But, if this goes on,

00:11:01.417 --> 00:11:04.168
they will be discovered by the One-eyed
Wolf Demons and the Cyclops.

00:11:05.568 --> 00:11:07.848
We sent many squads out there.

00:11:08.332 --> 00:11:11.172
More than 1000 One-eyed Wolf Demons
were killed.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:15.680
But, we have no idea why
the One-eyed Wolf Demons kept appearing.

00:11:16.271 --> 00:11:18.671
We haven't figured out...

00:11:19.083 --> 00:11:21.950
how did the One-eyed Wolf Demons
entered the city.

00:11:22.626 --> 00:11:27.793
So the only way is to kill
their leader, the Pterolycus.

00:11:28.563 --> 00:11:29.749
Killing the Pterolycus?

00:11:30.096 --> 00:11:31.056
Do you have confidence?

00:11:31.456 --> 00:11:32.984
Our boss is a level 3 mage.

00:11:33.247 --> 00:11:35.912
He's the only one that can go against
the Pterolycus in Bow City.

00:11:36.358 --> 00:11:37.478
50 percent chance of winning.

00:11:38.624 --> 00:11:42.811
But, if we don't clear the wolves
around the Pterolycus,

00:11:43.437 --> 00:11:46.358
then we won't even have...

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:48.033
10 percent chance of winning.

00:11:48.692 --> 00:11:50.585
That means we're going to be killed?

00:11:52.402 --> 00:11:53.775
We don't have much time.

00:11:53.894 --> 00:11:55.054
We can only kill by force.

00:11:55.295 --> 00:11:57.029
Even if we don't have
10 percent chance of winning,

00:11:57.203 --> 00:12:01.386
I can't let them roam free
in the city that I guard.

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:04.445
Mo Fan, you're talented.

00:12:04.525 --> 00:12:05.898
You'll be a great mage someday.

00:12:06.617 --> 00:12:07.950
Now, you're safe.

00:12:08.171 --> 00:12:11.038
The Black Curia didn't get
the Sacred Spring too.

00:12:11.643 --> 00:12:12.976
I'm relieved.

00:12:15.665 --> 00:12:17.212
Take good care of yourself.

00:12:19.873 --> 00:12:21.540
All troops were deployed.

00:12:21.641 --> 00:12:26.370
We're going against
a Commander level Pterolycus.

00:12:26.668 --> 00:12:28.937
We can only save Bow City by killing it.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.293
You are the strongest Military Mages
in Bow City.

00:12:32.526 --> 00:12:35.593
You've been fighting
with me for many years.

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:39.777
Today, it's either the creature's death
or our death.

00:12:40.456 --> 00:12:41.962
As it attacked our city,

00:12:42.234 --> 00:12:43.941
we will kill it even though
it's powerful.

00:12:45.764 --> 00:12:47.657
Kill the Pterolycus!

00:12:48.184 --> 00:12:50.064
Offer it as a sacrifice to
the dead souls of Bow City!

00:12:53.058 --> 00:12:54.151
Listen to my order!

00:12:55.126 --> 00:12:59.935
Come along with me
to kill that creature!

00:13:00.282 --> 00:13:01.176
Yes!

00:13:47.786 --> 00:13:48.706
What if...

00:13:49.398 --> 00:13:51.705
you knew that the weak boy you saved...

00:13:52.676 --> 00:13:55.170
become a Military Mage
that guards a city,

00:13:56.332 --> 00:13:57.989
and is strong enough...

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:00.777
to save thousands of girls like you?

00:14:02.511 --> 00:14:03.751
You'll smile...

00:14:04.649 --> 00:14:05.902
in heaven too, right?

00:14:07.283 --> 00:14:09.454
It's good to be alive.

00:14:23.771 --> 00:14:24.544
Mo Fan!

00:14:25.036 --> 00:14:25.862
Mo Fan!

00:14:26.712 --> 00:14:27.632
Mo Fan!

00:14:27.956 --> 00:14:28.437
Mo...

00:14:30.782 --> 00:14:31.569
Mo Fan!

00:14:55.075 --> 00:14:56.115
My son.

00:15:28.525 --> 00:15:29.685
Mo Fan!

00:15:33.575 --> 00:15:34.362
Ningxue?

00:15:38.919 --> 00:15:41.278
I believed that you're alive.

00:15:43.393 --> 00:15:44.460
Ningxue.

00:15:49.187 --> 00:15:52.410
Ningxue, you really came
to meet this scoundrel.

00:15:54.376 --> 00:15:57.056
Mo Fan, you ignored other students...

00:15:57.219 --> 00:15:59.299
and escaped into
the protective barrier yourself?

00:15:59.402 --> 00:16:00.722
We didn't escape.

00:16:01.145 --> 00:16:02.821
For those who didn't escape in time,

00:16:02.886 --> 00:16:05.287
we found a route for them
by risking our lives.

00:16:05.529 --> 00:16:07.662
People like you
who are powerful and rich...

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:09.220
could do more.

00:16:09.638 --> 00:16:10.705
But, you're here...

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:13.080
Don't criticise my dad.

00:16:16.575 --> 00:16:19.043
Go away.
I have many things to do.

00:16:19.352 --> 00:16:21.112
I don't have time to talk to you.

00:16:30.749 --> 00:16:33.836
Xinxia, dad.

00:16:49.247 --> 00:16:51.622
♪ Pressing onward courageously ♪

00:16:52.325 --> 00:16:55.735
♪ With the burning dreams in our heart ♪

00:16:56.005 --> 00:16:59.056
♪ We are reminiscing
the dreams of our past ♪

00:16:59.697 --> 00:17:01.177
♪ And it gives me strength ♪

00:17:01.578 --> 00:17:03.471
♪ The most stubborn wings ♪

00:17:04.085 --> 00:17:07.131
♪ Dreamt that we will not
wander anymore ♪

00:17:07.463 --> 00:17:11.388
♪ And hoped that we will
fly further one day ♪

00:17:12.861 --> 00:17:16.786
♪ With the dim lights
shining through the sky ♪

00:17:17.779 --> 00:17:22.726
♪ Shine through our heart
and fill in the ups and downs ♪

00:17:23.787 --> 00:17:27.048
♪ I'm as proud as the sun ♪

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:30.214
♪ The clouds are moving
in the distance ♪

00:17:30.481 --> 00:17:32.806
♪ Since I have decided to be unique ♪

00:17:32.949 --> 00:17:35.857
♪ I will break all barriers
and shine through ♪

00:17:36.182 --> 00:17:38.904
♪ Life is ever-changing ♪

00:17:39.039 --> 00:17:42.456
♪ But I will soar through the sky ♪

00:17:42.782 --> 00:17:44.751
♪ The hope that is beating within me ♪

00:17:45.323 --> 00:17:48.420
♪ Writes a new chapter for me ♪

00:17:48.965 --> 00:17:52.804
♪ We will battle once more
if we have the chance ♪

00:17:53.392 --> 00:17:59.629
♪ To be the everlasting light
in the world ♪
